{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女星宋慧喬2023年憑復仇劇《黑暗榮耀》首奪《百想藝術大賞》視后，再創事業高峰，她相隔3年再戰劇界，夥拍孔劉、雪炫、車勝元及李荷妮等合演製作費高達800億韓圜（約4.67億港元）的重頭劇《夢響年代》，並於下月11日登陸串流平台。</p><p>全劇合共</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:03:52.772938+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:46:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:16.688081+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:16.688081+00:00","content_hash":"940f1e74e26d6bb7219d33854e6e3fea6b6a5dba982f6adcfdc2fcc712bbae33","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}